          "passage": "______ in the 2005 paper that introduced the framework, the meta-research analyses subsequently published by John Ioannidis and his collaborators have routinely identified the same kind of inflation pattern in single-study findings across biomedical and social-scientific subfields, even where the methodologies differ substantially from those originally surveyed.",
